# While TLM has a lot of features, it also messes with a lot of stuff (such as car tags not being transparent when at their destination regardless of settings).
# I also just don't trust Rex, especially after his porting of people's mods without permission (and the ensuing crashout after getting banned for it).
# It's just childish, and any trust I had with him or RTM is gone. I scanned TLM, and it's safe, but I don't trust that it'll continue to be.
# So, we're using Extended Car Tags here.
